flowchart TD
    A[Platform Admin] --> B[Organizer Account]
    B --> C[Create Event]
    C --> D[Invite or Register Guard]
    D --> E[Assign Event and Gate]
    E --> F[Guard Login]
    F --> G[Open Assigned Event]
    G --> H[Scan QR Code]
    H --> I{Ticket Valid?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Mark Ticket Redeemed]
    J --> K[Show Entry Confirmation]
    I -- No --> L[Reject and Display Reason]
